   * @param departmentId Unique identifier of the department to delete (scoped to the current organization).
   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor member
   * @x-autobe-specification Soft-delete a department by setting its deleted_at timestamp to the current time.
   *
   * **Permission**: Require the org:manage permission. Reject with 403 Forbidden if the calling user lacks this permission.
   *
   * **Pre-deletion checks**:
   * 1. Query the department by departmentId scoped to the current organization (erp_hrm_organization_id). Return 404 if not found or already soft-deleted (deleted_at IS NOT NULL).
